[00:14.42]O Jehovah, God of goodness,
[00:18.66]You have blessed us all our days!
[00:23.52]You are holy, ever loyal,
[00:28.22]And so good in all your ways.
[00:32.84]You show favor, granting mercy,
[00:37.54]Far beyond what we deserve.
[00:42.10]You’re so worthy of our worship,
[00:46.72]And it’s you we gladly serve.
[00:54.72]Your own goodness is reflected
[01:02.40]In the people whom you choose;
[01:07.44]And the proof is in their conduct
[01:12.06]And the preaching of good news.
[01:16.66]Your good teaching, your good shepherds,
[01:21.32]Bear good fruit in many lands.
[01:25.94]May you grant us holy spirit,
[01:30.50]And may goodness guide our hands.
[01:44.44]May you bless our deeds of goodness
[01:48.64]To our brothers, great or small.
[01:53.48]May we show them special favor
[01:57.82]As we work at good t’ward all.
[02:02.84]In each fam’ly, congregation,
[02:07.40]In each town and neighborhood,
[02:12.06]With your blessing and your spirit,
[02:16.58]May we be a force for good.
